---
title: Sensor Node TX Data Flow
---
flowchart LR
    SENSORS["Fake Sensors\n(temp, hum, CO2, VOC)"]
    TRIG["sensor_trigger_chan"]
    EVT["sensor_event_chan\nenv_sensor_data"]

    subgraph sensor_node_tx
        LISTENER["zbus Listener\n(ADR-002: no blocking)"]
        LOCK["k_spinlock"]
        BUF["Ring Buffer\nenv_sensor_data[20]"]
        WIRE["Wire Array\nlora_reading[20]\n5 bytes each"]
        TIMER["k_work_delayable\n(CONFIG_SENSOR_NODE_TX_INTERVAL_S)"]
        FORCE["FORCE_TX\nconfig_cmd_chan"]
    end

    LORA["lora_node\nlora_node_transmit()"]
    AIR["((LoRa RF))"]

    SENSORS -->|trigger| TRIG
    TRIG -->|sample + publish| SENSORS
    SENSORS -->|publish| EVT
    EVT -->|callback| LISTENER
    LISTENER -->|lock| LOCK
    LOCK -->|copy| BUF
    BUF -->|unlock| LOCK

    TIMER -->|expiry| TX_PATH
    FORCE -->|command| TX_PATH

    subgraph TX_PATH[TX Path]
        SNAP["Lock → snapshot → convert\n→ unlock → transmit"]
    end

    BUF -->|convert| WIRE
    WIRE -->|5-byte readings| LORA
    SNAP -->|uses| BUF
    SNAP -->|writes| WIRE
    SNAP -->|calls| LORA
    LORA --> AIR

    style sensor_node_tx fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#22c55e
    style TX_PATH fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#f59e0b
    style SENSORS fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6
    style LORA fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#8b5cf6
